      "content": "i've tried that. i've tried the quiet rooms and the headphones and the meditation stuff but it doesn't work. the noise is still there in my head. it's like it's part of me now. i don't want a five minute break, i want it to just be... gone. i just want to find a way to get to actual silence. like, real, permanent silence where nothing can touch me anymore.",
